<title>KUWAIT: KOC extinguishes fire at gas boosting station.</title>
<headline>KOC extinguishes fire at gas boosting station.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kuwait Oil Company (KOC) said it has extinguished a fire at its gas boosting station 130 which resumed operations immediately after the blaze was controlled, the official Kuwait News Agency reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>KOC, the state's production arm, said workers succeeded in extinguishing the fire that broke out on Tuesday morning in less than an hour.</p>
<p>The agency did not give further details.</p>
</text>
